 "summary": "The new surface is minimal and consistent with the surrounding API: `linearMapAt_pullback` is `@[simp]` like its companions, `tensorEquivOfNeZero` has an unexposed body plus a simp apply lemma and a continuity lemma, and the private helper is a bundle-specific wrapper around facts Mathlib already has. There is no compatibility layer and no free data.",
